
# Browser time implementation: the page's own clock, the same `Date` global node reads. Webview and cloudflare borrow
# it. Without one, every page program that raised an exception failed to build, since an exception carries the time
# it was raised (exception.tree loads time). Internal: reached only through the public time API.

dock load
  load <global:Date>, name date

task epoch-millis
  like number
  send back
    call date/now
